      "body_line": 26,
      "text": "The inspected `create-service.js` reads bundled workspace/view templates from `System_Manager/ai-template`. Its scaffold path selects bundled view IDs and copies numbered view capsules into the machine-scoped `System/Views` root resolved by"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/001-Workspaces_And_Views/000-Workspaces_And_Views/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 12,
      "text": "Today, workspace creation copies selected **bundled** view templates into `ai/<machine>/System/Views/`; the renderer dispatches built-in view IDs to React components. These are source-inspected development-checkout facts, not a runtime cert"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/001-Workspaces_And_Views/000-Workspaces_And_Views/002-Decisions/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 17,
      "text": "The older proposed rule placing every installed view under `ai/<machine>/System/Views` is superseded as a **target**. That remains the observed current code path until the product changes. The older thin-instance interpretation is supersede"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/001-Workspaces_And_Views/000-Workspaces_And_Views/003-Unfinished_Work/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 22,
      "text": "**Target:** Editable instance folders live outside `System`, reference a protected view plugin and stay within that plugin's declared capabilities. **Current limit:** the view registry still discovers `ai/<machine>/System/Views/` capsules, "
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/001-Workspaces_And_Views/002-View_Architecture/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 6,
      "text": "Today the server discovers numbered folders under `ai/<machine>/System/Views/`. Each folder's `manifest.md` declares a canonical, unique `metadata.view-id`; its `name` is the display label. The numeric folder prefix controls order, with fol"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/001-Workspaces_And_Views/022-View_Configuration_And_Agents/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 18,
      "text": "Today `views/index.js` discovers numbered capsules in `ai/<machine>/System/Views/`, reads their `manifest.md`, `content.json` and styles, and `panel-paths.js` resolves access through that registry. `view-state/resolver.js` locates each caps"
    }
